cff-version: 1.2.0
message: "If you use this foundation, please cite it."
title: "website-foundation"
abstract: >-
  A portable, content-agnostic baseline for building and shipping a personal
  website, especially with AI coding tools: a working starter site, a
  zero-to-deployed quickstart, a guide to the design, voice and workflow
  decisions that make a site worth visiting, the URL/indexing contract and SEO
  invariants, Cloudflare deployment, and zero-dependency checkers that enforce
  the contracts in CI.
version: "1.1.0"
date-released: 2026-09-20
